WEBVTT

00:27:58.372 --> 00:28:01.936
amplified the challenges
of having heretical views.

00:28:01.960 --> 00:28:05.696
CM: I recognized that the only way
I could survive at the CIA

00:28:05.720 --> 00:28:09.106
was that I had to give up.

00:28:09.130 --> 00:28:12.106
I had to drop some of the things

00:28:12.130 --> 00:28:14.626
that I thought were
really important for me.

00:28:14.650 --> 00:28:20.227
So yes, in that sense,
I became less authentic.

00:28:20.251 --> 00:28:21.747
AG: This experience at the CIA

00:28:21.771 --> 00:28:25.016
knocked the authenticity
out of Carmen's self-expression.

00:28:25.040 --> 00:28:27.895
When other people dictate the terms
of your authenticity,

00:28:27.919 --> 00:28:30.326
that's the definition of inauthentic.